  "label": "Stereotype of Black Children in Media",
  "description": "The image of a young Black boy with a serious expression may implicitly reference cultural stereotypes that have historically portrayed Black children in media as either overly aggressive, hypersexualized, or emotionally stoic. While the image itself does not depict any stereotype, the visual of a Black child with a somber expression can be interpreted through the lens of these stereotypes, which may influence how the meme is perceived by different audiences.",
